  EpisodeWatched
  ProgressStarted
  ProgressCompleted
  ReviewAdded
  ListCreated
  ListItemAdded
  FavoriteAdded
  Followed
  CommentAdded
  ReactionAdded
  StreakBonus
  MissionCompleted
}

